      "description": "🧺 Jumbolita Multi-Purpose Household Organizer (Stock No. 2529)\nWelcome to the Artify Official Store! Declutter your home and maximize your storage space with the Jumbolita Multi-Purpose Household Organizer. Designed with convenience and space-saving in mind, these versatile baskets are perfect for keeping every room in your house neat and tidy.\n🌟 Key Features:\nSmart Stackable Design: Features a secure lid that allows you to safely stack multiple organizers on top of each other, maximizing your vertical storage space in cabinets and on shelves.\nIncluded Lid Cover: Keeps your stored items protected from dust and dirt while providing a flat surface for stable stacking.\n\nConvenient Pull Handle: Equipped with a sturdy handle on the front, making it incredibly easy to grab and pull the basket down from high pantry shelves or deep cabinets.\nVentilated Basket Weave: The breathable slotted design ensures excellent air circulation, making it ideal for storing pantry items, bathroom toiletries, and kitchen supplies.\nPerfect Dimensions: Measures D24 x W15 x H11.5 cm, offering a practical size that fits well in most standard cupboards and shelving units.\nAesthetic Muted Colors: Comes in clean, modern colors that easily blend with any home decor style.\n\nProudly Philippine Made: An authentic \"Product of the Philippines\" from the trusted Jumbolita Homeware brand.\nTake control of your clutter with a smart, stackable storage solution. Add these multi-purpose organizers to your cart today! 🛒",
